#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php:221
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php:230
msgid "Patsch9 Rental Engine for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Patsch9 Rental Engine for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php
msgid "https://github.com/patsch9/patsch9-rental-engine"
msgstr "https://github.com/patsch9/patsch9-rental-engine"

#. Description of the plugin
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php
msgid "Rental and equipment booking workflows for WooCommerce with availability, pricing, security deposits, terms, documents, and handover/return management."
msgstr "Miet- und Gerätebuchungsabläufe für WooCommerce mit Verfügbarkeit, Preisen, Kautionen, Mietbedingungen, Dokumenten sowie Übergabe- und Rückgabeverwaltung."

#. Author of the plugin
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php
msgid "Patrick Schmidt"
msgstr "Patrick Schmidt"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php
msgid "https://github.com/patsch9"
msgstr "https://github.com/patsch9"

#: includes/class-rmwc-legacy-migration.php:251
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:1983
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:2103
msgid "The rental configuration for this cart item is no longer available. Please remove the item and add it again."
msgstr "Die Mietkonfiguration dieses Warenkorbartikels ist nicht mehr verfügbar. Bitte entfernen Sie den Artikel und fügen Sie ihn erneut hinzu."

#: includes/class-rmwc-legacy-migration.php:294
msgid "Rental bookings are temporarily unavailable while rental data is being upgraded. Please try again later or contact the shop."
msgstr "Während der Aktualisierung der Mietdaten sind Mietbuchungen vorübergehend nicht möglich. Bitte versuchen Sie es später erneut oder kontaktieren Sie den Shop."

#: includes/class-rmwc-legacy-migration.php:335
msgid "Patsch9 Rental Engine migration stopped."
msgstr "Migration der Patsch9 Rental Engine wurde gestoppt."

#: includes/class-rmwc-legacy-migration.php:335
msgid "Rental data could not be upgraded safely. Existing data has been preserved and rental checkout is blocked. Please back up the database, check the database error log and resolve any conflicting legacy and current data before retrying."
msgstr "Die Mietdaten konnten nicht sicher aktualisiert werden. Vorhandene Daten bleiben erhalten; der Miet-Checkout ist gesperrt. Bitte ein Datenbank-Backup erstellen, das Datenbank-Fehlerprotokoll prüfen und Konflikte zwischen alten und neuen Daten vor einem erneuten Versuch beheben."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:293
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:300
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:1121
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:1129
msgid "Please select a valid rental period."
msgstr "Bitte einen gültigen Mietzeitraum wählen."

#. translators: %s: Localized weekday name.
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:311
#, php-format
msgid "Pickup or rental start is not available on %s. Please choose a different start date."
msgstr "Am %s ist keine Abholung bzw. kein Mietbeginn möglich. Bitte einen anderen Starttag wählen."

#. translators: %s: Localized weekday name.
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:311
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:318
msgid "selected weekday"
msgstr "gewählten Wochentag"

#. translators: %s: Localized weekday name.
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:318
#, php-format
msgid "Return is not available on %s. Please choose a different return date."
msgstr "Am %s ist keine Rückgabe möglich. Bitte einen anderen Rückgabetag wählen."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:337
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:347
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-documents.php:643
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-integrations.php:58
msgid "Rental"
msgstr "Vermietung"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:338
msgid "Offer this WooCommerce product as a rental item."
msgstr "Dieses WooCommerce-Produkt als Mietartikel anbieten."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:372
msgid "Basic data & times"
msgstr "Grunddaten & Zeiten"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:377
msgid "Default billing"
msgstr "Standard-Abrechnung"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:378
msgid "per day"
msgstr "pro Tag"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:378
msgid "per week (7 rental days)"
msgstr "pro Woche (7 Miettage)"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:378
msgid "per month (30 rental days)"
msgstr "pro Monat (30 Miettage)"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:379
msgid "Used if no price scale or weekend rule applies. For daily billing, individual weekdays may overwrite the standard price."
msgstr "Wird verwendet, wenn keine Preisstaffel oder Wochenendregel greift. Bei Tagesabrechnung können einzelne Wochentage den Standardpreis überschreiben."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:385
msgid "Standard rental price"
msgstr "Standard-Mietpreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:392
msgid "Available quantity"
msgstr "Verfügbare Anzahl"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:396
msgid "How many identical rental units of this product can be rented at the same time."
msgstr "Wie viele identische Geräte dieses Produkts gleichzeitig vermietet werden können."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:402
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:2874
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:2894
msgid "Pickup / rental start"
msgstr "Abholung / Mietbeginn"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:405
msgid "Example: 12:00. The booking starts at this time on the selected start date."
msgstr "Beispiel: 12:00. Ab diesem Zeitpunkt beginnt die Buchung am gewählten Startdatum."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:411
msgid "Return time"
msgstr "Rückgabezeit"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:414
msgid "Example: 10:00. By this time the item must be back on the return date."
msgstr "Beispiel: 10:00. Bis zu diesem Zeitpunkt muss der Artikel am Rückgabedatum zurück sein."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:424
msgid "Rental days are calculated from the pickup and return dates. A same-day rental counts as one rental day."
msgstr "Miettage werden anhand des Abhol- und Rückgabedatums berechnet. Eine Rückgabe am selben Tag zählt als ein Miettag."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:430
msgid "Maximum rental period"
msgstr "Maximale Mietdauer"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:433
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:451
msgid "0 or empty = unlimited."
msgstr "0 oder leer = unbegrenzt."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:438
msgid "Buffer after return (hours)"
msgstr "Puffer nach Rückgabe (Std.)"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:442
msgid "Additional buffer time after return, e.g. 2 hours for cleaning and inspection."
msgstr "Zusätzliche Sperrzeit nach der Rückgabe, z. B. 2 Stunden für Reinigung und Kontrolle."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:448
msgid "Max. advance booking (days)"
msgstr "Max. Vorausbuchung (Tage)"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:458
msgid "Weekdays & blocked days"
msgstr "Wochentage & Sperrtage"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:459
msgid "Set the weekdays on which pickup and return are available and define any weekday prices. A rental may continue across days on which pickup or return is unavailable."
msgstr "Lege fest, an welchen Wochentagen Abholung und Rückgabe möglich sind und ob an einzelnen Miettagen ein abweichender Tagespreis gilt. Laufende Vermietungen dürfen gesperrte Übergabetage überbrücken."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:468
msgid "No pickup"
msgstr "Keine Abholung"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:469
msgid "No rental start on this day"
msgstr "Kein Mietbeginn an diesem Tag"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:475
msgid "No return"
msgstr "Keine Rückgabe"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:476
msgid "No return on this day"
msgstr "Keine Rückgabe an diesem Tag"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:480
msgid "Daily price"
msgstr "Tagespreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:488
msgid "Standard price"
msgstr "Standardpreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:491
msgid "Empty = standard rental price"
msgstr "Leer = Standard-Mietpreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:499
msgid "Security deposit & handover"
msgstr "Kaution & Übergabe"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:504
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:1050
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:1880
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:3287
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-documents.php:467
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-documents.php:468
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-documents.php:664
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-workflow.php:639
msgid "Security deposit"
msgstr "Kaution"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:507
msgid "Refundable security deposit per rental unit."
msgstr "Rückzahlbare Sicherheitsleistung je vermietetem Gerät."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:513
msgid "Security deposit note"
msgstr "Hinweis zur Kaution"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:514
msgid "e.g. refunded after the returned item has been inspected."
msgstr "z. B. Rückzahlung nach Prüfung des zurückgegebenen Artikels."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:515
msgid "Optional free text displayed on the product page at the deposit amount."
msgstr "Optionaler Freitext, der beim Kautionsbetrag auf der Produktseite angezeigt wird."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:527
msgid "Allow pickup"
msgstr "Abholung erlauben"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:532
msgid "Allow delivery"
msgstr "Lieferung erlauben"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:533
msgid "Enabled: delivery by rental operator and return by customer."
msgstr "Ermöglicht die Lieferung durch den Vermieter und die Rückgabe durch den Kunden."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:539
msgid "Allow delivery and collection"
msgstr "Lieferung und Abholung erlauben"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:541
msgid "Allows: delivery and later collection by the rental operator. The transport price is charged per journey (return journey = 2 × price)."
msgstr "Ermöglicht: Lieferung und spätere Abholung durch den Vermieter. Der Transportpreis wird je Fahrt berechnet (Hin- und Rückfahrt = 2 × Preis)."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:547
msgid "Default transport fee per journey"
msgstr "Standard-Transportpauschale je Fahrt"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:550
msgid "Only used if no delivery zones are defined. The amount is per journey; at delivery and collection it is charged twice."
msgstr "Wird nur verwendet, wenn keine Lieferzonen definiert sind. Der Betrag gilt je Fahrt; bei Lieferung und Abholung wird er zweimal berechnet."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:557
msgid "Flexible pricing tiers"
msgstr "Flexible Preisstaffeln"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:558
msgid "Pricing priority: weekend rate → matching pricing tier → weekday rate → standard price. Example: from 7 rental days, a package price of €129 includes 7 days; each additional rental day costs €15."
msgstr "Preis-Priorität: Wochenendtarif → passende Preisstaffel → Wochentagspreise → Standardpreis. Beispiel: ab 7 Miettagen Paketpreis 129 € inkl. 7 Tage, danach 15 € je weiterem Miettag."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:560
msgid "Minimum days"
msgstr "Ab Miettagen"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:560
msgid "Maximum days"
msgstr "Bis Miettage"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:560
msgid "Package price"
msgstr "Paketpreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:560
msgid "Included days"
msgstr "Enthaltene Tage"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:560
msgid "Additional day"
msgstr "Weiterer Tag"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:563
msgid "+ Add pricing tier"
msgstr "+ Preisstaffel"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:567
msgid "Enable weekend rate"
msgstr "Wochenendtarif aktiv"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:568
msgid "Applies only when the start and return weekdays match exactly and the resulting duration is exact (e.g. Friday to Monday = 3 rental days)."
msgstr "Greift nur bei exakt passendem Start-/Rückgabe-Wochentag und genau der daraus folgenden Dauer (z. B. Freitag bis Montag = 3 Miettage)."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:573
msgid "Weekend price"
msgstr "Wochenendpreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:579
msgid "Weekend starts"
msgstr "Wochenende beginnt"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:585
msgid "Weekend ends"
msgstr "Wochenende endet"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:593
msgid "Add-ons & rental accessories"
msgstr "Zusatzoptionen & Miet-Zubehör"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:594
msgid "Use rental accessories for material variants and priced accessory items. Simple add-ons are intended for services or surcharges that do not require their own inventory items."
msgstr "Für Materialgrößen und bepreiste Zubehörartikel verwende Miet-Zubehör. Einfache Zusatzoptionen sind für Leistungen oder Aufschläge gedacht, die keinen eigenen Lagerartikel benötigen."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:597
msgid "Simple add-ons (without a separate WooCommerce product)"
msgstr "Einfache Zusatzoptionen (ohne eigenen WooCommerce-Artikel)"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:600
msgid "Group"
msgstr "Gruppe"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:600
msgid "Option"
msgstr "Option"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:600
msgid "Price"
msgstr "Preis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:600
msgid "Billing"
msgstr "Abrechnung"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:603
msgid "+ Add simple option"
msgstr "+ Zusatzoption hinzufügen"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:609
msgid "Delivery zones"
msgstr "Lieferzonen"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:610
msgid "Zones are evaluated according to the maximum travel distance per simple journey. The price is per journey. \"Delivery and collection by rental operator\" is the same fare twice. Google Routes API automatically determines the mileage; without API, the customer can manually select the zone."
msgstr "Zonen werden nach maximaler Fahrstrecke je einfacher Fahrt ausgewertet. Der Preis gilt je Fahrt. Bei „Lieferung und Abholung durch Vermieter“ wird derselbe Fahrpreis zweimal berechnet. Mit Google Routes API erfolgt die Kilometerermittlung automatisch; ohne API kann der Kunde die Zone manuell auswählen."

